WEBVTT

00:02.390 --> 00:11.290
To share this view, copy a link to the pull request's Files changed page, with two parameters: pantheon_panel, and page.

00:11.690 --> 00:13.790
Paste it into a new tab.

00:14.190 --> 00:21.290
With the extension installed, the tab becomes the review view. Without it, the link opens Files changed.

00:24.190 --> 00:27.290
The review queue skill prints these links for you.
